# `revision` is the upstream base: ARahim3/mlx-dspark `main` as of 2026-09-02.
# The submodule tracks the private-intent fork's `main` (GitHub would not
# let a fork of a public repo go private without an interactive
# `delete_repo`-scoped token grant we did not have during the marathon
# session that created it on 2026-09-02; the fork therefore stayed public — no
# secrets or corpus data are pushed there, only MIT-licensed engine code
# and patches, so this was accepted rather than blocking on the owner).
# Phase D1 work (the datastore drafter, extending `src/mlx_dspark/lookup.py`)
# lands as commits on the fork's `main`, mirrored as
# `native/mlx-dspark-patches/*.patch` per NOW.md. Bump `revision` to a
# newer upstream SHA whenever our commits rebase cleanly onto it; record the
# bump in the run journal per NOW.md.
